wgt 0.2
use std/nn
use std/heads
model std_mlp
input x: f32[2]
output logits: f32[3]
layer body: nn.mlp(in=2, hidden=8, out=4)
layer head: heads.classifier(in=4, classes=3)
data train:
  [-2, 0] -> [0]
  [2, 0] -> [1]
  [0, 2] -> [2]
init seed=42
train data=train loss=cross_entropy optimizer=adam lr=0.03 epochs=200
